WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.870
<b>It's medium isn't the armor.</b>

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.710
<b>The Ectoplasm.</b>

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.000
<b>Her real assault is yet to come.</b>

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.340
<b>Yet to come?</b>

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:17.470
<b>And the Shaman Fight has only just begun.</b>

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Only just begun?</b>

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.850
<b>She doesn't even know what's
going on over there right now!</b>

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.060
<b>This is too much fun.</b>

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.150
<b>Don't worry about a thing.</b>

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.530
<b>Yoh can than handle it.</b>

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:32.900
<b>Yoh?</b>

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.740
<b>Isn't that Mickey's son?</b>

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.450
<b>I know him!</b>

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.490
<b>I'm Anna the Itako.</b>

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.160
<b>Yoh's wife.</b>

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.160
<b>Wife?!</b>

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.000
<b>I'm Tamao, Mikihisa-sama's pupil.</b>

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.460
<b>N-nice to meet you.</b>

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.460
<b>I see, so you're the heir's wife.</b>

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:54.670
<b>No wonder you act like such a big shot.</b>

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:59.220
<b>Though I'm sure you'd be arrogant
anyway, considering who you are.</b>

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:01.510
<b>Aren't you obsessed.</b>

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:06.350
<b>We're not stupid, we
can tell you have powers.</b>

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:10.820
<b>Yeah, but I still say she
needs an attitude adjustment.</b>

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:17.360
<b>Not even your precious
Yoh-kun can handle everything.</b>

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:21.200
<b>One of them should
already be dead by now.</b>

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:24.000
<b>Wh-what do you mean?</b>

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:25.960
<b>You don't need to know.</b>

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:27.290
<b>Yeah, but...</b>

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.670
<b>Besides, you're late.</b>

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:32.250
<b>You have to get to the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.590
<b>We have to wait for Mickey.</b>

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:39.390
<b>And we can't leave you ladies behind.</b>

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.970
<b>This is your Shaman Fight.</b>

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:45.850
<b>Don't you care about your dream?</b>

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:48.900
<b>Sister...</b>

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:54.400
<b>Hey, we came here to
take those kids' souls.</b>

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:56.400
<b>I've had enough of you.</b>

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:58.530
<b>Then bring it on.</b>

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.330
<b>You guys are irritating me.</b>

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:08.500
<b>I didn't come here to listen to you
whine, so make your move or shut up.</b>

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.670
<b>What's with her Furyoku?</b>

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:18.970
Unyielding wish that rises in my chest

