00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:49.500
<b>Episode 29</b>

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:49.500
<b>Episode 29</b>

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.810
<b>D-Damn it!</b>

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.060
<b>Fine, let's do it</b>

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.440
<b>Getter, Getter Muingetter!</b>

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:57.150
<b>Come to life and cut off her head!</b>

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:00.110
<b>Over Soul: Jack the Ripper!</b>

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.490
<b>Trick or Treat!</b>

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:09.240
<b>Over Soul: Cupid</b>

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.540
<b>I will be the one to take you on.</b>

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.130
<b>Anna-sama get the kids to the stadium.</b>

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.790
<b>and go to Yoh-sama!</b>

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:19.880
<b>Over soul...</b>

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.510
<b>Western gunman doll.</b>

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:25.130
<b>Magnum Craft!</b>

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:29.930
<b>Over soul...</b>

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:31.770
<b>Angel!</b>

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.190
<b>She switched spirit allies!</b>

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.820
<b>Hmm, you're not bad.</b>

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.820
<b>Did you learn that from the Asakura?</b>

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:46.030
<b>If these kids are
Mikihisa-sama's teammates...</b>

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:49.160
<b>I'll fight to defend them.</b>

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.450
<b>Hey, Tamao!</b>

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.700
<b>Don't get too cocky.</b>

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.790
<b>Conchi and I are doing the actual fighting!</b>

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:58.580
<b>Me and Ponchi!</b>

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.630
<b>Okay, girls!</b>

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:04.340
<b>Now that we're here, you're gonna get it!</b>

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.340
<b>I'll get your balls!</b>

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.010
<b>And I'll squeeze them!</b>

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.060
<b>And I'll crush you.</b>

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.310
<b>This is so embarrassing...</b>

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:20.520
<b>You seem like a nice little girl,
but your spirit allies are clowns.</b>

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:25.650
<b>I can't believe my first attack missed.</b>

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:31.240
<b>It's not like we've
really gotten serious yet.</b>

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.510
<b>Indeed, Matilda-sama.</b>

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:41.130
<b>A corpse and two wretched animals,
it shouldn't take long to trounce this lot.</b>

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:44.170
<b>It's time to finish them.</b>

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:45.840
<b>What?</b>

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:50.180
<b>Don't rush in, I'll give you
plenty of time to fight him.</b>

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.140
<b>Anna-chan.</b>

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.560
<b>Take the children.</b>

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.930
<b>We can handle things over here.</b>

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.520
<b>Get to Yoh-sama's side, fast.</b>

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:02.440
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:04.150
<b>I'll go.</b>

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:05.360
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:11.950
<b>If you're worried about your man,
then just admit it and stop acting so cool.</b>

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:15.370
<b>I'm not scared of you.</b>

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:16.660
<b>C'mon, you guys!</b>

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:18.960
<b>Whoa..!</b>

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:20.670
<b>Sorry, but...</b>

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:24.300
<b>Anna-chan doesn’t have time
to deal with you right now.</b>

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:26.840
<b>But we'll take you on.</b>

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.550
<b>A pleasure to meet you.</b>

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.180
<b>We should be safe now.</b>

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:41.850
<b>Thanks, for coming all the way with us.</b>

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.070
<b>Don't thank me, I didn't do it for you.</b>

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.190
<b>You're breathing really hard.</b>

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.740
<b>Are you really okay?</b>

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.490
<b>That's...</b>

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.280
<b>Hmm...? Oh.</b>

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:55.240
<b>She's my little sister.</b>

00:06:55.830 --> 00:07:00.670
<b>If I didn't carry her.
she'd just sit there.</b>

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.630
<b>Can't you see?</b>

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:07.710
<b>She has no emotions.</b>

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:14.800
<b>Seyram's feelings all
dried up after the incident.</b>

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:16.600
<b>Incident?</b>

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:19.810
<b>On Christmas, 3 years ago...</b>

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:22.850
<b>Our dad was murdered.</b>

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.820
<b>I don't know who did it...</b>

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:28.990
<b>I don't remember my mom much...</b>

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:33.450
<b>Our dad was the only family we had.</b>

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.450
<b>That night...</b>

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:39.330
<b>We were waiting for him
to bring home the presents.</b>

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:43.790
<b>But Seyram couldn't wait, so
she had gone looking for him...</b>

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.090
<b>The next time we saw our father...</b>

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.380
<b>He was a snow covered corpse.</b>

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:57.010
<b>The first one discover him was Seyram...</b>

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:01.230
<b>And ever since...</b>

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:06.150
<b>But I'm going to make
Seyram right again someday.</b>

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:09.110
<b>That's why I entered the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:14.160
<b>Maybe the Great Spirit
can do something for her.</b>

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:18.950
<b>And if possible, I'd like to find our
father's killer too and take revenge.</b>

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:22.140
<b>It's not really a big dream
like you guys have...</b>

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:26.380
<b>My goal really isn't that big of a deal.</b>

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.380
<b>I don't get you.</b>

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:35.970
<b>If you're a Shaman, you could
just use your ghosts to find the killer.</b>

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:41.140
<b>Maybe, but we became Shamans
a long time after my dad got killed.</b>

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:48.270
<b>I only learned about Ghosts and Shamans
and this tournament a short time ago.</b>

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:51.360
<b>But it taught us everything.</b>

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:57.870
<b>It's an artificial human created
long ago to protect our ancestors...</b>

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:04.000
<b>Our dad traveled the world trying
to end conflict and revive a lost art.</b>

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:07.580
<b>The lost art of the Golem.</b>

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:12.670
<b>It's the only thing
our father left us...</b>

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:15.800
<b>A Golem?</b>

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:19.300
<b>You've heard of them?</b>

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:23.350
<b>I guess they're famous. Well,
this one is pretty awesome.</b>

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:28.520
<b>It doesn't talk, it knows
everything and it's really strong.</b>

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:32.710
<b>I don't know how it works, but
we've managed to get this far with it.</b>

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.950
<b>If that's a real golem,
your dad was a genius.</b>

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:39.950
<b>I'm so glad.</b>

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.870
<b>Which makes me hate
his murdered all the more.</b>

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:52.250
<b>So that means we have to work harder.</b>

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:53.880
<b>You...</b>

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:58.800
<b>Aw, take it easy, you don't have to worry about me.</b>

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:01.010
<b>So where is this Golem?</b>

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:05.890
<b>Oh no! I was so busy worrying
about Seyram that I forgot all about it!</b>

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.730
<b>Come to me, Shikigami!</b>

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:11.610
<b>Whoa!</b>

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:14.440
<b>Get ready to travel at super speed!</b>

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:17.240
<b>Hang on tight or you'll be shaken off!</b>

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.360
<b>Chesed.</b>

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.700
<b>Binah Yesod</b>

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:24.240
<b>Come here, Golem.</b>

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:38.260
<b>It comes to you?!</b>

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:43.680
<b>Yeah, I said I forgot it, not
that it wouldn't come to us.</b>

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:48.890
<b>But it was fun to see
you get all excited.</b>

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:56.190
<b>I bet if we had a mom, she's be like that
every morning when she sent us off to school.</b>

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:02.680
<b>Then maybe I should give you
a hundred whacks for being late!</b>

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.950
<b>L-let's get going!</b>

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:12.500
<b>Well, I'll be damned.</b>

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.880
<b>Fate is a funny thing.</b>

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:22.890
<b>Mikihisa, knowing what you know,
you still choose to go with them.</b>

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.520
<b>Jiang Si Jutsu: Bao Fu!</b>

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.270
<b>Conchi! Planchette form!</b>

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.020
<b>Dao Dan Do!</b>

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.940
<b>Yeah, go Conchi!</b>

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:42.820
<b>Bursting continent verge missile kick!</b>

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:45.200
<b>Love Strike!</b>

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.830
<b>Surely...
We got them!</b>

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.870
<b>Heehee, that's not good at all</b>

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:57.710
<b>A puny kick like that can't stop my dolly.</b>

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.430
<b>Magnum Craft!</b>

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:07.050
<b>They thought they could handle
us with just the two of them?</b>

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.970
<b>That's just insulting!</b>

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:15.020
<b>Waah! My tail!</b>

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.900
<b>Don't die, Conchi!</b>

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.530
<b>Lowly animal spirits...</b>

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.240
<b>You should disappear!</b>

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.490
<b>Pyron!</b>

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:31.080
<b>I'll fight this one...</b>

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.710
<b>You take care of the other two...</b>

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.750
<b>B-but...</b>

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:38.790
<b>You're gonna fight him?</b>

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.920
<b>You got stabbed to save us?!</b>

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.630
<b>Pyron...</b>

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:48.430
<b>Heh, there's your champion of justice.</b>

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:54.600
<b>But not even a corpse can take
that kind of punishment for long.</b>

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.650
<b>That's what makes you guys weak.</b>

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:02.820
<b>It's foolish to compromise yourself,
in a battle you can't afford to lose.</b>

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:04.070
<b>Fool.</b>

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.650
<b>Shut up.</b>

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.660
<b>No man lives alone.</b>

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:14.290
<b>He who only looks out for himself will
soon find himself alone and withered.</b>

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:18.830
<b>A fist without a heart
can never achieve victory!</b>

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:22.420
<b>What's that idiot talking about?</b>

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:25.800
<b>Look at the situation you're in!</b>

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:30.050
<b>Ha, it's pointless Matilda-sama.</b>

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:33.930
<b>His brain has rotted away.</b>

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.650
<b>I can't free my lance!</b>

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.730
<b>Well done, Pyron.</b>

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:46.450
<b>The kinetic vision to
block an arrow with a knife.</b>

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:50.570
<b>The strength to block
Pyron's kick with a doll.</b>

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.370
<b>These thing are already
beyond the human limit.</b>

00:13:55.120 --> 00:14:00.330
<b>You predict the future and
parry your enemy's attacks.</b>

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.250
<b>The Shamanic Oracle...</b>

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:06.920
<b>I finally understand.</b>

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:09.090
<b>So that's how it is!</b>

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:11.470
<b>You can't escape anymore!</b>

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:14.560
<b>I'll pulverize you until you can no longer move!</b>

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:18.310
<b>Oh! Did he allow my lance
to pierce him on purpose?</b>

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:26.190
<b>But sadly the weak will remain weak.</b>

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.200
<b>What the hell?!</b>

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:37.910
<b>I am who I am.</b>

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:55.100
<b>Smoke?</b>

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:59.310
<b>I suppose you'd like
to know how I did that.</b>

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.690
<b>Only a fool gives away his secrets!</b>

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:05.570
<b>Pyron!</b>

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:10.650
<b>The armor isn't the medium, it's a decoy!
The real medium is her cigarette smoke!</b>

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:15.080
<b>Hmm, you're a sweet child so I'll make an exception for you.</b>

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:18.660
<b>Indeed, the smoke is my medium.</b>

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:25.250
<b>But because it's smoke,
I can never be captured.</b>

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:26.840
<b>Ponchi!</b>

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:27.960
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:30.760
<b>I'll trap you in my ghost bubble!</b>

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:33.300
<b>Over Soul: Angel!</b>

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:36.560
<b>Tan Tan Tanuki and it's
1000 tatami ghost bubble!</b>

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:41.060
<b>No, I dislike close places.</b>

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.560
<b>I'll pass.</b>

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.650
<b>Uh oh, they popped his bubble.</b>

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:50.650
<b>Ponchi!</b>

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.950
<b>Y-You..!</b>

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:58.330
<b>You can't fight in your
condition, my dear martial artist.</b>

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.910
<b>The weak shall remain weak.</b>

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:06.210
<b>All you can do is scream your head off.</b>

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:07.710
<b>Pyron!</b>

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:16.800
<b>I'll go ahead on my bike.</b>

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.180
<b>Be sure to catch up.</b>

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:22.730
<b>It's our job to hunt
the souls of those kids.</b>

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:24.980
<b>They won't get away from me.</b>

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.900
<b>I hate walking...</b>

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:31.030
<b>Are they really that important.</b>

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:38.530
<b>I don't know, I'm gonna make that
cocky girl tell me who she really is.</b>

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:47.250
<b>Besides, those kids have to be
more interesting than those two.</b>

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:49.170
<b>Ponchi...</b>

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.050
<b>Pyron...</b>

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.130
<b>Seriously.</b>

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:56.970
<b>What where they thinking, picking a fight with us.</b>

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:02.220
<b>I feel like I want to kill them.</b>

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:09.150
<b>Anyway, if we fed their
souls to the Spirit of Fire...</b>

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:13.030
<b>Hao-sama might appreciate it.</b>

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:16.780
<b>I really hate them.</b>

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.240
<b>M-Marie-chan?</b>

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.910
<b>Oh, here we go again.</b>

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:30.250
<b>It's always the same, people like
them are the reason my life is so hard.</b>

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:34.470
<b>These wimps attract each
other and dream their dreams.</b>

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:39.060
<b>Keep your greasy hands
off my video games after you eat potato chips.</b>

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:42.060
<b>I hate clingy, slimy people.</b>

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.850
<b>Oh well, it can't be helped.</b>

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:52.320
<b>Marie-chan and I are
totally devoted to Hao-sama.</b>

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:56.820
<b>We can't dawdle here...</b>

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:00.700
<b>But we all feel the same way.</b>

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:07.750
<b>Once people called us witches and persecuted us
because they thought they were better than us.</b>

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:12.170
<b>I will never forgive...</b>

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:14.510
<b>Those burning times.</b>

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:18.680
<b>And now you will know our pain!</b>

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:22.760
<b>Let's get out of here,
Tamao! They're crazy!</b>

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:24.850
<b>I can't.</b>

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:28.140
<b>Neither can I.</b>

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.400
<b>What's the problem, Tamao?!</b>

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:33.440
<b>Because these people's Furyoku...</b>

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:38.860
<b>It's so horrible deep and dark and sad...</b>

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.160
<b>I can't fight against it.</b>

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:47.750
<b>Haha, I'll take the one in the pink!</b>

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.040
<b>That's far enough.</b>

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.050
<b>What?!</b>

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:08.230
<b>My smoke medium that no one can
attack, was vanquished by Furyoku...</b>

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:12.900
<b>That was close.</b>

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:16.860
<b>Looks like Anna has taken them away.</b>

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:22.450
<b>Thank goodness, you're all safe now.</b>

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.580
<b>Undershorts...</b>

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:28.250
<b>Aaah!
A pervert!</b>

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.420
<b>I'm not a pervert.</b>

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:36.710
<b>I'm Asakura Yoh's father, Asakura Mikihisa.</b>

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.970
<b>We're not interested in small fry!</b>

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.300
<b>How dare you come all of a sudden!</b>

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.680
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:58.230
<b>Young ladies should avoid using foul
language, and behave in a civilized manner.</b>

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:02.150
<b>Why, you! Even my parents never hit me!</b>

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:08.200
<b>Then I'll be your new daddy. Feel
free to talk to me about anything.</b>

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:11.710
<b>This guy is creepy.</b>

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:16.340
<b>It's not unusual for
dolls to have souls.</b>

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:19.960
<b>You can have it back,
take good care of him.</b>

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.510
<b>Hey, what are you doing, Ashcroft!</b>

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.760
<b>And for you, this is not good for your health.</b>

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:29.510
<b>When did you...</b>

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.560
<b>And you two...</b>

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:40.070
<b>What were you fighting for?</b>

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:45.450
<b>It's a good thing to fight to protect others.</b>

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:50.740
<b>But what's the point of fighting when
the ones you want to protect are gone?</b>

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.920
<b>It would be tragedy if you got killed.</b>

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:59.710
<b>What does he mean "You're all safe".</b>

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:04.260
<b>Disgusting sentimentality, it makes me sick.</b>

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:05.800
<b>What a wimp.</b>

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:08.680
<b>We are your enemies!</b>

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:11.440
<b>Friend or foe, it makes no difference.</b>

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:17.100
<b>Power crushes everything.</b>

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:20.650
<b>Good people and bad people...</b>

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:28.450
<b>Everyone lies prostrate before great power.</b>

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.390
<b>Then we all die and turn to dust.</b>

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:35.080
<b>You've had a brush with death.</b>

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:42.590
<b>If those kids had activated the
golem of war, we'd all be dead now.</b>

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.890
<b>That's their terrible power.</b>

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:53.770
<b>That's why I stay close to them.</b>

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:58.350
<b>Children are naive and innocent,
which makes them more dangerous.</b>

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:03.030
<b>They may lie, but they will
always be true to themselves.</b>

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:06.400
<b>And that is the truth.</b>

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:10.200
<b>Truth is, reality cannot be altered.</b>

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:15.160
<b>There's nothing crueler or
more commonplace than truth.</b>

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.960
<b>Go home, if you have homes.</b>

00:22:18.710 --> 00:22:22.790
<b>Don't throw away the lives I've saved.</b>

00:22:26.630 --> 00:22:28.510
<b>Who cares what you say?</b>

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:30.260
<b>Don't bother.</b>

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:32.760
<b>With your abilities...</b>

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:34.350
<b>You cannot defeat that man</b>

00:22:34.930 --> 00:22:36.680
<b>Do as he says and go.</b>

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:38.690
<b>You're late.</b>

00:22:39.390 --> 00:22:41.100
<b>Is that your personal spirit?</b>

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:43.020
<b>Young officiant...</b>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:50.490
<b>Indeed, I call it magnascope.</b>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:52.160
<b>Magna-san!</b>

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:53.080
<b>Go now</b>

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:55.160
<b>Didn't you hear me the first time?</b>

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:55.990
<b>Team Flower</b>

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:03.090
<b>So that Golem had powers
we didn't know about...</b>

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:07.220
<b>You uncovered important
information, you've done enough.</b>

00:23:08.420 --> 00:23:09.930
<b>It's over.</b>

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:12.840
<b>Kanna Bismarch, the ectoplasmatic.</b>

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:15.310
<b>Marion Fauna, the doll master.</b>

00:23:15.760 --> 00:23:18.140
<b>Matilda Mathis, the wudumaer.</b>

00:23:19.180 --> 00:23:20.100
<b>Let's go.</b>

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:23.520
<b>You guys are still useful.</b>

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:31.150
<b>Mikihisa-sama, those girls...</b>

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:33.410
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:37.990
<b>(Mikihisa) Nothing can be done, nothing...</b>

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:44.500
<b>Is that how it is, Yoh?</b>

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.990
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 1</b>

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.990
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 1</b>

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:50.800
<b>Next time: "Osorezan Le Voile Part 1"</b>

